{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A MINIMALIST COLORFUL LANDSCAPE BUILDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/about.gif?t=1744895865\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf33 Paint the terrain and place natural elements to <strong>grow a beautiful landscape tile by tile</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udeb8 Discover <strong>many biomes</strong> organized in <strong>three main climates</strong>: temperate, polar and tropical</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d Never compose the same landscape twice with <strong>procedurally generated archipelagos</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcaf Leverage <strong>various intuitive placement rules</strong> to maximize your <strong>score</strong> and your <strong>strategy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 Appreciate <strong>colorful 3D pixel art visuals</strong> with <strong>dynamic lightning</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Enjoy a <strong>relaxing</strong> and <strong>peaceful experience</strong> that you can come back to once in a while</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Unleash <strong>your creativity</strong> and watch <strong>your tiny landscape</strong> slowly getting back to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/radiant.png?t=1744895865\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT RADIANT SLOTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Radiant Sloth (he/him) is a <strong>solo indie game developer</strong> from France, He has a passion for creating <strong>inspiring and entertaining art</strong>, and is committed to <strong>ethical and sustainable game development</strong>. In particular, he strives to maintain <strong>honest and transparent communication</strong> with the community, advocates <strong>awareness of carbon footprint</strong> and climate issues, and <strong>bans generative AI tools</strong> from his creation process.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655260?t=1744895865","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655260?t=1744895865","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/509cac7ee7edc8d5d903e32155bc8043805d72b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744895865","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/509cac7ee7edc8d5d903e32155bc8043805d72b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744895865","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A MINIMALIST COLORFUL LANDSCAPE BUILDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/about.gif?t=1744895865\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf33 Paint the terrain and place natural elements to <strong>grow a beautiful landscape tile by tile</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udeb8 Discover <strong>many biomes</strong> organized in <strong>three main climates</strong>: temperate, polar and tropical</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0d Never compose the same landscape twice with <strong>procedurally generated archipelagos</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcaf Leverage <strong>various intuitive placement rules</strong> to maximize your <strong>score</strong> and your <strong>strategy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa8 Appreciate <strong>colorful 3D pixel art visuals</strong> with <strong>dynamic lightning</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f Enjoy a <strong>relaxing</strong> and <strong>peaceful experience</strong> that you can come back to once in a while</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf31 Unleash <strong>your creativity</strong> and watch <strong>your tiny landscape</strong> slowly getting back to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/extras/radiant.png?t=1744895865\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT RADIANT SLOTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Radiant Sloth (he/him) is a <strong>solo indie game developer</strong> from France, He has a passion for creating <strong>inspiring and entertaining art</strong>, and is committed to <strong>ethical and sustainable game development</strong>. In particular, he strives to maintain <strong>honest and transparent communication</strong> with the community, advocates <strong>awareness of carbon footprint</strong> and climate issues, and <strong>bans generative AI tools</strong> from his creation process.</p>","developers":["Radiant Sloth"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655260/4acd4a06467a262ea01db4d5a76b825debf145aa/header.jpg?t=1744895865","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Radiant Sloth \u00a9 2025 - present. All rights reserved.<br>The key art illustration is a variation of the painting <i>Kustlandschap te Corsica</i> by Charles William Meredith van de Velde (1828 - 1892).","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for OpenG